---
description: >-
  label-syntax.mmd with `markdownAlwaysOn: true` (#1368, #1403): every label is markdown, so the
  plain `**bold** _ital_` rows of the title, the sections and the leaves draw bold and italic,
  and the code-span rows draw inline code. The picture differs from label-syntax.mmd; tags and
  `\n` draw as there.
config:
  markdownAlwaysOn: true
